---

<section id="screen-results" class="relative z-10 w-[92%] max-w-md glass-panel rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-6 text-center hidden flex-col items-center max-h-[96dvh]">
    <img id="result-mascot" src="/images/celebra.png" alt="Celebrando" class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 object-contain mb-1 drop-shadow-md">
    
    <!-- Player Name Display (Prominente y Claro) -->
    <div class="mb-1">
        <span class="text-[11px] uppercase font-black tracking-wider text-slate-500 block">Eco-Explorador Participante</span>
        <div id="result-player-name" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-emerald-800 leading-tight">Nombre</div>
    </div>

    <h2 id="result-title" class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-emerald-600 mb-1.5">¡ECO HÉROE! 🏆</h2>
    
    <!-- Puntuación Compacta Horizontal -->
    <div class="w-full bg-white/85 rounded-xl py-1.5 px-4 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
        <span class="text-xs font-black text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Puntuación Final:</span>
        <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-emerald-600" id="result-score">8/8</span>
    </div>

    <p id="result-msg" class="text-slate-600 font-semibold mb-2 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-snug">
        ¡Felicidades! Has completado el desafío ambiental.
    </p>

    <!-- WhatsApp CTA (Recordatorio de las 2 capturas) -->
    <div class="w-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-300 rounded-xl p-2.5 mb-2.5 text-left shadow-sm">
        <p class="text-slate-700 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold leading-tight">
            📸 <span class="text-emerald-800 font-black">Envía tus 2 capturas:</span> Toma captura de este puntaje y envíala junto a la captura de tu foto por WhatsApp al <strong class="text-emerald-700 font-black">913346476</strong> para registrarte y reclamar tu Insignia.
        </p>
    </div>

    <a id="btn-whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/51913346476?text=¡Hola!%20Completé%20el%20desafío%20EcoGuardianes%20🌎" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-full bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#1fb855] text-white font-black text-sm sm:text-base py-2.5 sm:py-3 rounded-xl border-b-4 border-emerald-700 shadow-sm active:border-b-2 active:translate-y-1 transition-all flex justify-center items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp text-lg sm:text-xl"></i> Enviar por WhatsApp
    </a>

    <button id="btn-restart" class="w-full bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-900 text-white font-black text-xs sm:text-sm py-2 sm:py-2.5 rounded-xl border-b-4 border-slate-950 shadow-sm active:border-b-2 active:translate-y-1 transition-all flex justify-center items-center gap-2">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left"></i> Volver al inicio
    </button>
</section>
